---
const lanes = [
  { name: "Sam", hold: null },
  { name: "Maya", hold: "ad" },
  { name: "Leo", hold: null },
] as const;
---

<section class="flag" aria-labelledby="flag-title" data-reveal>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="flag-title" class="giant">
      <span class="l1">Nobody</span>
      <span class="l2">gets left</span>
      <span class="l3 em">behind.</span>
    </h2>

    <div class="grid">
      <div class="copy">
        <p class="lede">
          Maya's video stops for an ad. On a normal watch party, the room drifts apart and someone
          types "wait, pause". WatchSync pauses everyone, tells them why, and starts the room again
          the moment she's back.
        </p>
        <p>
          It does the same when someone's video is still loading. If a wait runs past 90 seconds,
          the others choose: keep waiting, or watch without her.
        </p>
      </div>

      <figure class="lanes">
        <div class="rows" aria-hidden="true">
          {
            lanes.map((l) => (
              <div class="lane">
                <span class="name">{l.name}</span>
                <span class="bar">
                  <span class="seg played" />
                  <span class:list={["seg", l.hold ? "ad" : "wait"]}>{l.hold ? "Ad · 0:20" : "waits"}</span>
                  <span class="seg played after" />
                </span>
              </div>
            ))
          }
          <span class="playhead"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="cards" aria-hidden="true">
          <p class="card wait-card">
            <span class="dot"></span>Maya is on an ad · about 0:20 left
          </p>
          <p class="card back">Back together</p>
        </div>
        <figcaption>
          While Maya watches her ad, Sam and Leo wait at the same frame. Their screens say
          "Maya is on an ad · about 0:20 left", then "Back together" when everyone plays again.
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .flag {
    position: relative;
    padding-top: clamp(48px, 13vw, 200px);
  }
  .giant {
    margin-top: 22px;
    font-size: clamp(4.2rem, 16.5vw, 15rem);
    font-weight: 640;
    line-height: 0.84;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
    font-variation-settings:
      "opsz" 144,
      "SOFT" 30;
  }
  .giant span {
    display: block;
  }
  .l2 {
    padding-left: 0.9em;
    color: var(--text2);
    font-weight: 300;
  }
  .l3 {
    padding-left: 0.4em;
    font-weight: 380;
  }
  /* The last line arrives late, then lands in place with the others. */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .flag[data-reveal] .l3 {
      transition:
        transform 1.1s var(--ease) 0.5s,
        opacity 0.8s ease-out 0.5s;
    }
    :global(.js) .flag[data-reveal]:not(.in) .l3 {
      transform: translateX(-0.6em);
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
    gap: clamp(32px, 5vw, 80px);
    align-items: start;
    margin-top: clamp(40px, 6vw, 80px);
  }
  .copy {
    display: grid;
    gap: 20px;
    color: var(--text2);
  }
  .copy .lede {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .lanes {
    margin: 0;
    padding: clamp(20px, 3vw, 32px);
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: var(--surface);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line);
  }
  .rows {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .lane {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 72px 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .name {
    font-weight: 650;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .bar {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 38fr 26fr 36fr;
    height: 30px;
    gap: 3px;
  }
  .seg {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .played {
    background: rgba(236, 242, 241, 0.85);
  }
  .after {
    background: rgba(236, 242, 241, 0.32);
  }
  .ad {
    background: var(--warn);
    color: #1b1503;
  }
  .wait {
    color: var(--text);
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(
      -45deg,
      rgba(255, 159, 74, 0.2) 0 6px,
      rgba(255, 159, 74, 0.07) 6px 12px
    );
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 159, 74, 0.4);
  }
  /* One playhead through every lane: the room's position. */
  .playhead {
    position: absolute;
    top: -8px;
    bottom: -8px;
    left: calc(84px + (100% - 84px) * 0.64);
    width: 2px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: var(--acc);
    box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(255, 210, 90, 0.7);
  }
  .playhead::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: -6px;
    left: -5px;
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--acc);
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .flag[data-reveal] .playhead {
      transition: left 2.6s cubic-bezier(0.45, 0, 0.2, 1) 0.3s;
    }
    :global(.js) .flag[data-reveal]:not(.in) .playhead {
      left: 84px;
    }
  }
  .cards {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }
  .card {
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--bg);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    box-shadow:
      0 8px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45),
      inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(214, 236, 240, 0.12);
  }
  .dot {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    margin-right: 9px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--warn);
  }
  .back {
    color: var(--pres);
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-top: 18px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text2);
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .lane {
      grid-template-columns: 56px 1fr;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .playhead {
      left: calc(64px + (100% - 64px) * 0.64);
    }
    .seg {
      font-size: 0.62rem;
    }
  }
</style>
